Description: fate/hevc: test the AuxId of an alpha layer with its own dependency id
 .
 Decode with -err_detect compliant an x265 alpha stream whose VPS
 extension has spatial or quality scalability with dependency id 0 and
 an auxiliary layer with AuxId 1, the alpha layer. The frames must be
 yuva420p with the alpha plane.
 .
 The sample is a stream made by x265 --alpha with one bit of the VPS
 changed by the script attached to the pull request.
 .
